  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat is a global community in multiple time zones across the world. Having a way to notify users of events happening in their local time is super important to organizing events. Discord has already implemented a solution to this.... Which is auto translate Unix time code to local time. I.E. <t:1719788400:F>  = Sunday, June 30, 2024 6:00 PM CST. I would like to see VRChat allow Group announcements to insert and auto translate Unix time to local time.  \n\nHere is an example site I use to get Unix time stamps for discord:\n\nhttps://r.3v.fi/discord-timestamps/",
